## Model work
For the project run, the training script compared Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and XGBoost. Logistic Regression had the best average recall in cross-validation; it was evaluated on held-out data and then retrained on all records in the separate local training database. The 8-customer demo database is too small for training. The model estimates general cancellation risk, not who will cancel in a particular week. Do not use its list by itself to decide whom to contact.

